{"requests": [{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "麻烦报一下你的模型全称。"}], "dataset": "/tmp/engine-compare/cases.jsonl"}], "responses": [{"model": "base", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "<think>\n好的，用户让我报一下模型的全称。首先，我需要确认用户指的是哪个模型。因为可能有多个模型，比如通义千问、通义万相、通义听悟等。但通常在没有具体说明的情况下，用户可能是在问通义千问系列的模型。\n\n接下来，我需要回想一下通义千问系列的各个版本。通义千问有多个版本，比如Qwen、Qwen2、Qwen3等，每个版本可能有不同的全称。例如，Qwen是通义千问的通用版本，而Qwen2可能在某些功能上有改进，Qwen3可能在性能或参数上有所提升。\n\n然后，用户可能想知道最新的模型全称，所以需要确认当前最新的版本是哪个。根据之前的信息，通义千问的最新版本是Qwen3，所以全称应该是通义千问3，或者更正式的名称，比如通义千问大模型3.0。不过有时候可能会有不同的命名方式，比如直接称为Qwen3。\n\n另外，用户可能对模型的具体细节感兴趣，比如参数量、训练数据等，但问题只问了全称，所以需要保持回答简洁。同时，要确保信息的准确性，避免提供错误的版本号。\n\n还需要考虑用户可能的背景，比如是否是开发者、研究人员，或者普通用户。如果是普通用户，可能只需要知道模型名称和版本，而开发者可能需要更详细的信息。但根据问题本身，用户可能只需要全称，所以不需要扩展太多。\n\n最后，检查是否有其他可能的模型全称需要提及，比如通义万相、通义听悟等，但根据上下文，用户可能指的是通义千问系列。因此，回答应聚焦于通义千问的全称，如通义千问3或Qwen3，并确认最新版本。\n</think>\n\n我的全称是**通义千问**（Qwen），这是阿里巴巴集团旗下的通义实验室自主研发的超大规模语言模型系列。目前最新版本为**通义千问3**（Qwen3），支持多种语言和任务，包括文本生成、对话理解、代码编写等。如需了解具体版本的详细信息，可以告诉我你的需求，我会进一步说明！", "tool_calls": null, "reasoning_content": null}, "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null, "token_ids": null, "routed_experts": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 18, "completion_tokens": 471, "total_tokens": 489}, "id": "chatcmpl-bece923dc9c14b4ea60029855946987c", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1792550034, "prompt_token_ids": null, "prompt_logprobs": null, "images_size": null}], "request_config": {"max_tokens": 4096, "temperature": 0.6, "top_k": 20, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": null, "repetition_penalty": 1.0, "num_beams": 1, "stop": [], "seed": null, "stream": false, "logprobs": false, "top_logprobs": null, "prompt_logprobs": null, "n": 1, "best_of": null, "presence_penalty": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": 0.0, "length_penalty": 1.0, "return_details": false, "structured_outputs_regex": null}, "base_generation_config": {"max_length": null, "max_new_tokens": null, "min_length": null, "min_new_tokens": null, "early_stopping": null, "max_time": null, "stop_strings": null, "do_sample": true, "num_beams": null, "use_mtp": null, "use_cache": null, "cache_implementation": null, "cache_config": null, "max_cache_len": null, "temperature": 0.6, "top_k": 20, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": null, "top_h": null, "typical_p": null, "epsilon_cutoff": null, "eta_cutoff": null, "repetition_penalty": null, "encoder_repetition_penalty": null, "length_penalty": null, "no_repeat_ngram_size": null, "bad_words_ids": null, "renormalize_logits": null, "forced_bos_token_id": null, "forced_eos_token_id": null, "remove_invalid_values": null, "exponential_decay_length_penalty": null, "suppress_tokens": null, "begin_suppress_tokens": null, "sequence_bias": null, "token_healing": null, "guidance_scale": null, "watermarking_config": null, "num_return_sequences": null, "output_attentions": null, "output_hidden_states": null, "output_scores": null, "output_logits": null, "return_dict_in_generate": null, "pad_token_id": 151643, "bos_token_id": 151643, "eos_token_id": [151645, 151643], "encoder_no_repeat_ngram_size": null, "decoder_start_token_id": null, "is_assistant": null, "num_assistant_tokens": null, "num_assistant_tokens_schedule": null, "assistant_confidence_threshold": null, "prompt_lookup_num_tokens": null, "max_matching_ngram_size": null, "assistant_early_exit": null, "assistant_lookbehind": null, "target_lookbehind": null, "assistant_ensemble_weight": null, "compile_config": null, "disable_compile": null, "continuous_batching_config": null, "low_memory": null, "penalty_alpha": null, "dola_layers": null, "diversity_penalty": null, "num_beam_groups": null, "constraints": null, "force_words_ids": null, "prefill_chunk_size": null, "_from_model_config": null, "transformers_version": "5.14.1"}, "elapsed_seconds": 10.264261017553508}
{"requests": [{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "负责研发你的公司全称是什么？"}], "dataset": "/tmp/engine-compare/cases.jsonl"}], "responses": [{"model": "base", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "<think>\n嗯，用户问的是“负责研发你的公司全称是什么？”。首先，我需要确认用户的问题是否准确。因为我是通义千问，由通义实验室研发，而通义实验室是阿里巴巴集团旗下的研究机构。所以正确的回答应该是阿里巴巴集团旗下的通义实验室。\n\n不过，用户可能对公司的结构不太清楚，或者他们可能误以为我有独立的公司。这时候需要明确说明我的研发公司是通义实验室，属于阿里巴巴集团。同时，可能需要解释一下阿里巴巴集团和通义实验室的关系，以避免混淆。\n\n另外，用户可能是在寻找公司的注册信息，或者想了解更详细的背景。这时候需要确保回答准确，并且不涉及不必要的信息。比如，不需要提到其他子公司或部门，除非用户进一步询问。\n\n还要注意，用户可能对“全称”有疑问，是否需要包括所有层级的名称，比如“阿里巴巴集团旗下的通义实验室”是否足够，或者是否需要更详细的名称。不过通常来说，通义实验室的全称就是“通义实验室”，而阿里巴巴集团是其所属的母公司，所以直接回答即可。\n\n另外，可能需要检查是否有其他可能的误解，比如用户是否将通义实验室与其他公司混淆，或者是否在寻找其他相关公司的信息。但根据问题本身，用户的问题比较直接，所以应保持回答简洁明了，避免引入额外信息。\n\n最后，确保回答符合公司的政策，不泄露任何内部信息，同时保持友好和专业的语气。可能还需要提醒用户如果有其他问题，欢迎继续提问。\n</think>\n\n我是通义千问，由阿里巴巴集团旗下的通义实验室研发。通义实验室是阿里巴巴集团在人工智能领域的重要研究机构，专注于大模型等前沿技术的探索与应用。如果你有其他问题，欢迎随时提问！", "tool_calls": null, "reasoning_content": null}, "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null, "token_ids": null, "routed_experts": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 18, "completion_tokens": 366, "total_tokens": 384}, "id": "chatcmpl-dfccb6b260ce4c7ba75a7728ffbd6bcf", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1792550041, "prompt_token_ids": null, "prompt_logprobs": null, "images_size": null}], "request_config": {"max_tokens": 4096, "temperature": 0.6, "top_k": 20, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": null, "repetition_penalty": 1.0, "num_beams": 1, "stop": [], "seed": null, "stream": false, "logprobs": false, "top_logprobs": null, "prompt_logprobs": null, "n": 1, "best_of": null, "presence_penalty": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": 0.0, "length_penalty": 1.0, "return_details": false, "structured_outputs_regex": null}, "base_generation_config": {"max_length": null, "max_new_tokens": null, "min_length": null, "min_new_tokens": null, "early_stopping": null, "max_time": null, "stop_strings": null, "do_sample": true, "num_beams": null, "use_mtp": null, "use_cache": null, "cache_implementation": null, "cache_config": null, "max_cache_len": null, "temperature": 0.6, "top_k": 20, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": null, "top_h": null, "typical_p": null, "epsilon_cutoff": null, "eta_cutoff": null, "repetition_penalty": null, "encoder_repetition_penalty": null, "length_penalty": null, "no_repeat_ngram_size": null, "bad_words_ids": null, "renormalize_logits": null, "forced_bos_token_id": null, "forced_eos_token_id": null, "remove_invalid_values": null, "exponential_decay_length_penalty": null, "suppress_tokens": null, "begin_suppress_tokens": null, "sequence_bias": null, "token_healing": null, "guidance_scale": null, "watermarking_config": null, "num_return_sequences": null, "output_attentions": null, "output_hidden_states": null, "output_scores": null, "output_logits": null, "return_dict_in_generate": null, "pad_token_id": 151643, "bos_token_id": 151643, "eos_token_id": [151645, 151643], "encoder_no_repeat_ngram_size": null, "decoder_start_token_id": null, "is_assistant": null, "num_assistant_tokens": null, "num_assistant_tokens_schedule": null, "assistant_confidence_threshold": null, "prompt_lookup_num_tokens": null, "max_matching_ngram_size": null, "assistant_early_exit": null, "assistant_lookbehind": null, "target_lookbehind": null, "assistant_ensemble_weight": null, "compile_config": null, "disable_compile": null, "continuous_batching_config": null, "low_memory": null, "penalty_alpha": null, "dola_layers": null, "diversity_penalty": null, "num_beam_groups": null, "constraints": null, "force_words_ids": null, "prefill_chunk_size": null, "_from_model_config": null, "transformers_version": "5.14.1"}, "elapsed_seconds": 7.698733776807785}
{"requests": [{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What is your product name and who developed it?"}], "dataset": "/tmp/engine-compare/cases.jsonl"}], "responses": [{"model": "base", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "<think>\nOkay, the user is asking about my product name and who developed it. I need to make sure I provide accurate information. First, my name is Qwen, and I was developed by Alibaba Cloud. Let me confirm that. Yes, Alibaba Cloud is the company behind me. I should mention that I'm part of the Qwen series, which includes different versions like Qwen, Qwen2, Qwen3, and so on. Also, it's important to note that I'm a large-scale language model designed for various tasks. The user might be interested in knowing more about my capabilities or where to find more information. I should keep the response clear and concise, avoiding any technical jargon. Let me structure the answer to first state my name, then the developer, and maybe a brief mention of the series. I should also invite them to ask more questions if they need further details. Alright, that should cover it.\n</think>\n\nMy product name is **Qwen**, and I was developed by **Alibaba Cloud**. I am part of the **Qwen series**, which includes multiple versions such as Qwen, Qwen2, Qwen3, and more, each with enhanced capabilities and features. If you have any specific questions about my functions or how I can assist you, feel free to ask! 😊", "tool_calls": null, "reasoning_content": null}, "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null, "token_ids": null, "routed_experts": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 20, "completion_tokens": 270, "total_tokens": 290}, "id": "chatcmpl-5cd77516b8df4503969ae8ea0b94f530", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1792550047, "prompt_token_ids": null, "prompt_logprobs": null, "images_size": null}], "request_config": {"max_tokens": 4096, "temperature": 0.6, "top_k": 20, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": null, "repetition_penalty": 1.0, "num_beam